# UX Refinement — Home, Favorites, Icons and Show Detail

## Objective

Perform a focused UX/UI refinement pass on the existing Show Explorer application.

The application is already functional.

Do not redesign architecture, state management, API behavior or business logic.

The goal is to improve:

- Home visual hierarchy;
- safe-area/header behavior;
- filter clarity;
- icon consistency;
- Favorites visual cleanliness;
- Show Detail vertical proportions;
- season accordion interaction quality.

Preserve all existing functionality and tests.

---

