Before modifying code, read:

1. `AGENTS.md`
2. relevant sections of `docs/SPEC.md`
3. relevant sections of `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
4. relevant sections of `docs/DECISIONS.md`
5. `src/features/shows/SKILL.md`
