Remove the redundant Favorites content header currently displaying:

```text
Favorites
```

and its descriptive paragraph.

The Favorites tab/navigation already communicates the current destination.

Do not duplicate that information inside the content area.

The screen should begin more directly with:

```text
Search
Filters
Favorites list
```

or the appropriate empty/hydration state.

