# 14. Favorites Layout

After removing the title/description:

- adjust top spacing intentionally;
- ensure content does not look vertically detached;
- preserve safe-area behavior;
- keep Search and filters visually aligned with Home.

Home and Favorites should feel like related discovery experiences.

They do not need to be pixel-identical, but Search/Filter components should preserve consistent styling and spacing.

